  "description": "Get in where you fit in. The Haro SI is an affordable, entry-level race bike. Built on a lightweight aluminum frame with our 3D dropout design with built-in chain tensioners for easy adjustments. The SI has more race ready features like Kenda Kontact tires, V-brakes, a railed Haro seat and an integrated headset for low-maintenance. Top it off with custom Haro graphics for a high-speed look. It's ready when you are.\n6061 alloy frame with 3D dropouts with integrated chain tensioners, 19.5\" top tube\nFull hi-tension steel fork with 1 1/8\" threadless steer tube\nHi-ten 7.5\" bar and Haro alloy front load stem\n1-piece 165mm crank with USA loose ball BB\nHaro padded fully adjustable seat\nKenda Kontact 20x1.95\" front and 1.75\" rear tires",
